#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:2 04455a996b83493ea3cb1780e303dd4d
msgid "Distributed FEM"
msgstr "分布式有限元方法"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:4 77f55d2a5b984e3bb66c6a8a8dbb552d
msgid ""
"When a problem no longer fits on one device — memory-wise or time-wise — "
"TensorMesh can partition the mesh, assemble each subdomain on its own GPU "
"(or CPU rank), and hand the result to ``torch-sla``'s distributed sparse "
"solver as one logical system. The whole pipeline stays in the familiar "
"shape:"
msgstr ""
"当问题在单设备上无法容纳——无论是内存还是时间方面——TensorMesh 可以对网格进行分区，在每个子域上分别于各自的 GPU（或 CPU "
"进程）进行装配，然后将结果作为单一逻辑系统交给 ``torch-sla`` 的分布式稀疏求解器。整个流程保持熟悉的形态："

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:14 6d440b64f93c4157b6c2eeaa0c64853e
msgid ""
"Everything lives in :mod:`tensormesh.distributed` (see the :doc:`API "
"reference </api/distributed>`), and the solver side is ``torch-sla``'s "
"``DSparseTensor`` machinery — domain decomposition with owned-rows-plus-halo"
" partitions, which upstream benchmarks have scaled past 400M DOF on multi-"
"GPU nodes."
msgstr ""
"所有功能均位于 :mod:`tensormesh.distributed`\\ （参见 :doc:`API 参考 "
"</api/distributed>`\\ ），求解器端则是 ``torch-sla`` 的 ``DSparseTensor`` 机制——基于「拥有行 "
"+ halo」分区的域分解，上游基准测试已将其扩展至超过 4 亿自由度（DOF）的多 GPU 节点。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:22 289b4c10de504e388b348f787a300b20
msgid ""
"The distributed layer is functional end-to-end (assembly → boundary "
"conditions → multi-GPU CG → verified against analytical solutions), but some"
" contracts are **interim** and may change: the "
":class:`~tensormesh.Condenser` bridge currently round-trips through a "
"gathered single-device matrix, and the distributed RHS assembly still "
"returns the full-length vector on every rank. The decorator covers the "
"**single-field** assemblers only — "
":class:`~tensormesh.MixedElementAssembler` is not yet supported (its block "
"DOF layout needs a global numbering layer across partitions; see the ROADMAP"
" for the plan). Worked examples with multi-GPU benchmark numbers will be "
"added to the example gallery once they are validated on a multi-card "
"cluster."
msgstr ""
"分布式层已完成功能性端到端验证（装配 → 边界条件 → 多 GPU 共轭梯度法 → 与解析解对比验证），但部分接口为\\ **临时性**\\ "
"的，可能发生变化：\\ :class:`~tensormesh.Condenser` "
"桥接目前需通过汇聚到单设备矩阵再返回，且分布式右端项（RHS）装配仍在每个进程上返回完整长度的向量。该装饰器仅覆盖\\ **单场**\\ "
"装配器——:class:`~tensormesh.MixedElementAssembler` 尚未支持（其块自由度布局需要跨分区的全局编号层；详见 "
"ROADMAP 中的计划）。多 GPU 基准测试的完整示例将在多卡集群上验证后添加至示例库。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:37 93f4411a882b460cb34943431be9757e
msgid "Partitioning the mesh"
msgstr "网格分区"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:39 3af38237d4084f22842642f3f83945ca
msgid ""
":class:`~tensormesh.distributed.DistributedMesh` wraps the mesh partitioner:"
" it splits a global :class:`~tensormesh.Mesh` into submeshes and assigns "
"each to a device. Every submesh keeps an ``orig_nid`` entry in its "
"``point_data`` — the local-to-global node map that the assembly layer uses "
"to scatter into global coordinates."
msgstr ""
":class:`~tensormesh.distributed.DistributedMesh` 封装了网格分区器：它将全局 "
":class:`~tensormesh.Mesh` 分割为子网格，并将每个子网格分配到一个设备。每个子网格在其 ``point_data`` 中保留 "
"``orig_nid`` 条目——即装配层用于散射到全局坐标的局部到全局节点映射。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:55 b6aa49bbb0064ad092d1d8ffbc4d0417
msgid ""
"Three partitioning methods are available via ``method=``: ``\"coordinate\"``"
" (recursive coordinate bisection — fast, the default), ``\"spectral\"`` "
"(Fiedler-vector bisection), and ``\"metis\"`` (graph partitioning, needs "
"``pymetis``). Build and partition on **CPU** first and let the submeshes "
"carry the device assignment — the partitioners index on CPU."
msgstr ""
"可通过 ``method=`` 选择三种分区方法：\\ ``\"coordinate\"``\\ （递归坐标二分法——快速，默认）、\\ "
"``\"spectral\"``\\ （Fiedler 向量二分法）和 ``\"metis\"``\\ （图分区，需要 ``pymetis``\\ "
"）。先在 **CPU** 上构建并分区，然后让子网格携带设备分配——分区器在 CPU 上建立索引。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:64 db64430a062045de8da85313e87bf8d1
msgid "Making any assembler distributed"
msgstr "使任意装配器支持分布式"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:66 768748b0e75d4fca828146ee6416e850
msgid ""
"You do not write a second assembler for the distributed path. The "
":func:`~tensormesh.distributed.distributed` class decorator turns any "
"existing :class:`~tensormesh.ElementAssembler` or "
":class:`~tensormesh.NodeAssembler` subclass — built-in or your own — into "
"its distributed counterpart by swapping the two entry points: ``from_mesh`` "
"accepts a ``DistributedMesh``, and ``__call__`` runs the distributed "
"assembly:"
msgstr ""
"无需为分布式路径编写第二个装配器。\\ :func:`~tensormesh.distributed.distributed` 类装饰器可将任何现有的 "
":class:`~tensormesh.ElementAssembler` 或 :class:`~tensormesh.NodeAssembler` "
"子类——内置或自定义——转换为其分布式对应版本，通过交换两个入口点实现：\\ ``from_mesh`` 接受 "
"``DistributedMesh``\\ ，\\ ``__call__`` 执行分布式装配："

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:82 1bb58627873a49ba9cd0d95099bac29a
msgid ""
"The weak form, quadrature setup, and element kernels are inherited unchanged"
" — the decorator only reroutes *where* the element loops run and *how* the "
"results are stitched together. Constructor arguments still go through "
"``from_mesh(dmesh, **kwargs)`` and call-time data (``point_data`` etc.) "
"through the call, exactly like the single-device contract."
msgstr ""
"弱形式、求积设置和单元核函数均原样继承——装饰器仅重新路由\\ *单元循环在何处运行*\\ 以及\\ *结果如何拼接*\\ 。构造参数仍通过 "
"``from_mesh(dmesh, **kwargs)`` 传递，调用时数据（\\ ``point_data`` "
"等）通过调用传递，与单设备约定完全一致。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:89 60ce760cc3704ba7b438092d9ac259e5
msgid "Underneath, two execution modes cover the common deployments:"
msgstr "底层有两种执行模式覆盖常见部署场景："

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:91 1912546feca5451bac066815901d8c9d
msgid ""
"**Single process, multiple devices.** Without an initialized "
"``torch.distributed`` process group, submeshes are assembled in parallel "
"*threads*, one per device, and merged. This is the low-friction mode: no "
"launcher, works in a notebook, and on a CPU-only machine it simply simulates"
" the partition — useful for testing partition-dependent code before renting "
"the GPUs."
msgstr ""
"**单进程，多设备。** 在未初始化 ``torch.distributed`` 进程组的情况下，子网格以\\ *线程*\\ "
"方式并行装配，每个设备一个线程，然后合并。这是低门槛模式：无需启动器，可在 notebook 中运行，且在仅 CPU 机器上它仅模拟分区——适用于在租用"
" GPU 之前测试依赖分区的代码。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:97 70f35a077c6444fbaf22aec99c349db7
msgid ""
"**One process per rank (SPMD).** Under ``torchrun``, each rank assembles "
"**only its own submesh**; the resulting COO triples are routed to the rank "
"that owns their row via a single ``all_to_all`` exchange (NCCL on CUDA, gloo"
" on CPU), halo columns are discovered automatically, and each rank ends up "
"with exactly its owned-rows-plus-halo slice. This is the mode that scales."
msgstr ""
"**每 rank 一个进程（SPMD）。** 在 ``torchrun`` 下，每个 rank 仅装配\\ **自己的子网格**\\ ；生成的 COO "
"三元组通过单次 ``all_to_all`` 交换路由到拥有其行的 rank（CUDA 上使用 NCCL，CPU 上使用 gloo），halo "
"列自动发现，每个 rank 最终获得精确的拥有行加 halo 的切片。这是可扩展的模式。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:104
#: 02a95aa1d24f4f8d84d2d77360d12cd7
msgid ""
"The free functions behind the decorator — "
":func:`~tensormesh.distributed.distributed_element_assemble`, "
":func:`~tensormesh.distributed.distributed_element_assemble_per_rank`, "
":func:`~tensormesh.distributed.distributed_node_assemble` — are public too, "
"plus ``distributed_element_assemble_to_sparse`` which merges everything back"
" into a plain global :class:`~tensormesh.sparse.SparseMatrix` (handy for "
"verifying the distributed result against the single-device one)."
msgstr ""
"装饰器背后的自由函数——:func:`~tensormesh.distributed.distributed_element_assemble`\\ "
"、\\ :func:`~tensormesh.distributed.distributed_element_assemble_per_rank`\\ "
"、\\ :func:`~tensormesh.distributed.distributed_node_assemble`——也是公开的，外加 "
"``distributed_element_assemble_to_sparse``\\ ，它将所有内容合并回普通的全局 "
":class:`~tensormesh.sparse.SparseMatrix`\\ （便于将分布式结果与单设备结果对比验证）。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:115
#: 3ce240d6ad3341eca61e4d27f925cabb
msgid "The distributed matrix"
msgstr "分布式矩阵"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:117
#: bcc8ca026b794c9abe32de2fb9aced3c
msgid ""
"Distributed assembly returns a "
":class:`~tensormesh.distributed.DSparseMatrix` — a subclass of "
"``torch_sla.distributed.DSparseTensor``, the same way "
":class:`~tensormesh.sparse.SparseMatrix` subclasses "
"``torch_sla.SparseTensor``. Because it *is* a ``DSparseTensor``, every "
"torch-sla API accepts it directly: ``@`` matvecs, arithmetic, I/O, and — "
"most importantly — the distributed solver. Two FEM-specific additions:"
msgstr ""
"分布式装配返回 :class:`~tensormesh.distributed.DSparseMatrix`——它是 "
"``torch_sla.distributed.DSparseTensor`` 的子类，正如 "
":class:`~tensormesh.sparse.SparseMatrix` 是 ``torch_sla.SparseTensor`` "
"的子类。因为它\\ *就是* ``DSparseTensor``\\ ，所有 torch-sla API 均可直接接受：\\ ``@`` "
"矩阵向量乘法、算术运算、I/O，以及——最重要的——分布式求解器。两个 FEM 特定的扩展："

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:126
#: d207fa302db748e796136116c3ca4d5a
msgid ""
"a **partition UUID** folded into ``layout_signature`` — generated on rank 0 "
"and broadcast, so repeated assemblies on the same partition share "
"condensation caches, while two independently partitioned matrices never do "
"(even if their local layouts happen to coincide);"
msgstr ""
"一个\\ **分区 UUID** 嵌入 ``layout_signature``——在 rank 0 "
"上生成并广播，因此同一分区上的重复装配共享凝聚缓存，而两个独立分区的矩阵永远不会共享（即使它们的局部布局恰好重合）；"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:131
#: 95fe82acd4844f5a9b2196136d6654fe
msgid ""
"``to_single()`` — allgather the distributed matrix back into one "
":class:`~tensormesh.sparse.SparseMatrix`, for verification and small-scale "
"debugging."
msgstr ""
"``to_single()``——将分布式矩阵全收集（allgather）回单个 "
":class:`~tensormesh.sparse.SparseMatrix`\\ ，用于验证和小规模调试。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:137
#: 1ebfe3bda109482f980d33b8788830c1
msgid "Boundary conditions and the distributed solve"
msgstr "边界条件与分布式求解"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:139
#: 75a10a3e7f3744c99e6bb97f80b7f441
msgid ""
"The unchanged :class:`~tensormesh.Condenser` dispatches on the matrix type: "
"handing it a ``DSparseMatrix`` routes through the distributed bridge. Two "
"practical rules in the current (interim) contract:"
msgstr ""
"未作改动的 :class:`~tensormesh.Condenser` 根据矩阵类型进行分发：传给它 ``DSparseMatrix`` "
"即通过分布式桥接路由。当前（临时）约定中的两条实用规则："

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:143
#: 4fb6b32357a143479b2e56ab658a76f3
msgid ""
"build the Dirichlet mask on **CPU** (``mesh.boundary_mask.cpu()``) — the "
"condensation buffers then stay on CPU and the bridge moves the condensed "
"output back to the GPU itself;"
msgstr ""
"在 **CPU** 上构建狄利克雷掩码（\\ ``mesh.boundary_mask.cpu()``\\ ）——凝聚缓冲区随后保留在 CPU "
"上，桥接将凝聚输出移回 GPU；"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:146
#: 0f85fd4a62754be0a998aa76b6511acf
msgid ""
"the solver consumes each rank's **owned slice** of the RHS and returns the "
"owned slice of the solution — slice before, gather after."
msgstr "求解器消耗每个 rank 的 RHS **拥有切片**\\ ，并返回解的拥有切片——先切片，后收集。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:167
#: b0b31714c1c2491bbbde5f24e416ab97
msgid ""
"Note that the solve goes through the ``torch_sla.solve`` **free function** —"
" ``DSparseTensor`` deliberately has no instance ``.solve()`` — and works on "
"``DSparseMatrix`` precisely because of the subclass relationship. "
"Distributed solves are iterative (preconditioned CG for the SPD systems FEM "
"produces); see :doc:`linear_solvers` for where that sits in the backend "
"matrix."
msgstr ""
"注意求解通过 ``torch_sla.solve`` **自由函数**\\ 进行——``DSparseTensor`` 故意不设实例 "
"``.solve()``——正因为子类关系，它才能在 ``DSparseMatrix`` 上工作。分布式求解为迭代式（FEM 产生的 SPD "
"系统采用预处理 CG）；参见 :doc:`linear_solvers` 了解其在后端矩阵中的位置。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:176
#: 87751f7fe5cf4301b4899b31b4958a49
msgid "Keeping ranks consistent"
msgstr "保持各 rank 一致"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:178
#: 5b0b97e916eb4af18d737ed5c0984c6d
msgid ""
"Under SPMD every rank executes the whole script, so anything random — a "
"sampled coefficient field, a randomized load — would silently diverge across"
" ranks and the solver would converge to a rank-dependent answer. "
":func:`~tensormesh.distributed.broadcast_from_rank0` wraps the draw:"
msgstr ""
"在 SPMD 下每个 rank 执行整个脚本，因此任何随机性——采样系数场、随机化载荷——都会在各 rank 间静默发散，求解器将收敛到随 rank "
"而异的答案。\\ :func:`~tensormesh.distributed.broadcast_from_rank0` 封装了该抽取："

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:190
#: 2f038654dc4344269fe3ab35e9cd8ab4
msgid ""
"Rank 0 evaluates the closure; every other rank receives the broadcast "
"tensor. In single-process runs it short-circuits to a plain call, so the "
"same script stays valid both ways."
msgstr "rank 0 求值闭包；其他每个 rank 接收广播的张量。在单进程运行中它短路为普通调用，因此同一脚本在两种方式下均有效。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:196
#: 5f4993afe1264a50941e81d2b2e6de2d
msgid "A complete ``torchrun`` skeleton"
msgstr "完整的 ``torchrun`` 骨架"

