#: ../../source/user_guide/distributed.rst:257
#: 9453ea6274764acea4d13fe069558502
msgid ""
"The `torch-sla documentation <https://www.torchsla.com/>`_ — "
"``DSparseTensor``, ``Partition``, and the distributed solver internals."
msgstr ""
"`torch-sla 文档 <https://www.torchsla.com/>`_——``DSparseTensor``\\ 、\\ "
"``Partition`` 以及分布式求解器内部机制。"
